{
  "action": "talk_to_Rita",
  "words": "Morning, Rita. Yeah, heard the groundhog on the radio. I'm up, I'm ready. Let's get to the studio and nail that weather file before eight. Then I'm straight to the depot for the one o'clock coach back to Pittsburgh. Can you have the camera rig staged by the time we get there, Larry's on the other end?",
  "intention": "Lock in the 8 AM weather segment with Rita and Larry, then head to the depot for the 1:00 PM coach to Pittsburgh before the Wednesday couch move.",
  "detail": "I rub the back of my neck with one hand as I speak, still shaking off the last of the sleep."
}
